    "Scan of the 1978 edition of the Caborn, Indiana, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1913; aerial photographs from 1974; field checked in 1975; last revised in 1978; printed in 1979.",
